WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.682
Hi there! I'm Sen, and I
carry messages for Seneca.

2
00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:09.354
Have you ever noticed how every audience
takes things in a little differently?

3
00:00:09.654 --> 00:00:13.844
Some people want the number,
plain and simple, right at the top.

4
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:17.980
Some want to see it move,
so the idea clicks as it plays.

5
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.095
And some would rather try it
themselves, one step at a time.

6
00:00:22.395 --> 00:00:23.550
So that's my job.

7
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.110
I deliver every message
in the format that fits.

8
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.695
And it all opens for anyone.
A link, a PDF, a video.

9
00:00:31.695 --> 00:00:33.643
No special software.

10
00:00:33.943 --> 00:00:36.018
Okay, I've got deliveries to make.

11
00:00:36.018 --> 00:00:38.391
Thanks for watching, see you soon!
